        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_telegraph_loop",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "'All units, this is Dispatch.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'All units, cease fire immediately. We have an urgent request from Deity Grypherburg.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Repeat, all units, cease fire immediately.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Please acknowledge.'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Exhales)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Scope of the ceasefire?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "All active units.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radioman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Nods)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Acknowledged.'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Inform Lieutenant Yelchin and ensure that all units in the 2nd Division observe the ceasefire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "'All units remain on standby. Maintain battle stations.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Until the threat is completely eliminated, we shall continue to serve our duty to protect Deity Grypherburg and the people.'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_funnel_end_h"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Summon the quartermaster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, we do not have a quartermaster for this operation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "You expected this to be only a quick response, and that it would not take much time to eliminate the rebellious Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Respond to Dispatch as usual.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what is your name, soldier?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Private Vyacheslav Kinov, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well. Inform the Lieutenant, Private Kinov. Your services are not needed here for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_warehouse_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1978_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...You had me leave my post to come to you for this little thing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're out of your mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, look at you, Patya, all high and mighty in that Shieldguard armor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does that pretty helmet of yours block your sight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "The maggots in the rations, bolts that snap like twigs, even duds!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this what they send us out to die with?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1978_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If there are maggots in your rations, you eat them with the rations. If the weapons are hard to use, use your bare hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're soldiers. We fight and win. There are only two ends: Keep fighting, or die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one who's out of his mind!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1978_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you find that someone hasn't been doing his job, you report to your superior, not complain to me here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not the quartermaster\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_armyboots_walk",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought the Defender Regiments were supposed to be on the top deck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1978_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sorry, sir. I was away from my post.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will report this to the commissar myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Salutes)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_armour"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "S-Sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you find out, soldier?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me the reason for your anger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The quality of our supplies and equipment on this operation is exceedingly poor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "The rations are insufficient, the cans damaged and filled with maggots...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Many of the bolts were not made of steel, but crude iron.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the reserve Originium bombs are so weak that they're little more than glorified duds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "How are we supposed to proceed the operation with these?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you enlist, soldier?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "To...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Speak up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "To\u2014to prove myself! I want people to know my name\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like they know yours!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They'll know your name when the Army sends your tags back to your mother, and she etches them on a white birch tree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, not like that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is little room for the individual to choose, when the collective is at war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep this hope in your heart, boy, and your 'discovery' too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "For the survival of Ursus and her people, there is only one option...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
